      "updated": 1767171196197,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: in oops + dsa ( 45-60mins ) -> never ever write dao, its timetaking\nbecause you now need to write every function in dao , its too time taking. -> only do in MC ( >=90mins ) \n\nelse -> either write those store in service itself and can use normally. \nor type dao in public and use it directly. \n\ninterface sucks some time, since you can't call other function, keep this in mind.\nfinal -> only file -> all model there, one service -> have either dao without method or direct in service",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: in oops + dsa ( 45-60mins ) -> never ever write dao, its timetaking\nbecause you now need to write every function in dao , its too time taking. -> only do in MC ( >=90mins ) \n\nelse -> either write those store in service itself and can use normally. \nor type dao in public and use it directly. \n\ninterface sucks some time, since you can't call other function, keep this in mind.\nfinal -> only file -> all model there, one service -> have either dao without method or direct in service",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
